Sure. POST to `/api/elements` with `type: 'wall'` and include `wall_layers` in `parameters`:

```json
{
  "type": "wall",
  "parameters": {
    "wall_layers": [
      { "material": "concrete", "thickness": 200, "function": "structure" },
      { "material": "insulation", "thickness": 80, "function": "insulation" },
      { "material": "gypsum", "thickness": 12, "function": "finish" }
    ]
  }
}
```

Or use the wall type catalog — POST `/api/catalog/wall-types` first, bind `wall_type_id` on the element.
